    },
    {
      "id": "2123256161705316851",
      "text": "Final: Mavericks 116, Warriors 94 Warriors have lost 4 straight. Blown out by 38, 21, and 22. Totally unrecognizable without Steph Curry. Defense has fallen apart, too, especially in transition. Will Richard showed up. Cooper Flagg is different. Warriors at MEM tomorrow night.",
