    {
      "id": "2123117073396289609",
      "text": "Yaxel Lendeborg said the last time his scoring was so needed for a team was his second year at UAB: “I kind of threw that out of my mind. I didn’t think I’d ever be in that position again.” Said he is becoming more comfortable with idea he can be lead NBA creator https://t.co/GVqtl2LkJz",
