    {
      "id": "2123101224241094787",
      "text": "The Warriors have ruled reserve guard Brandon Williams out of the final two games of their current road trip but indicate another evaluation will come Saturday. He’s back on the court and return appears imminent. Warriors particularly need his offense without Steph Curry.",
      "url": "https://x.com/anthonyVslater/status/2123101224241094787",
      "published": "2026-11-18T17:09:11+00:00",
      "likes": 1877,
      "author": "Anthony Slater",
