      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123101158906695740",
      "text": "Per Warriors: Brandon Williams (hamstring) will be re-evaluated again on Saturday, knocking him out from at least tonight and tomorrow’s contests. Williams has missed the last three games with the hamstring strain. GSW really misses his on-ball playmaking.",
